<p></p>
<i>
<p></p>
In recent quarters, loan delinquencies and charge-offs have declined in some loan classes while stabilizing or moving higher in other loan classes.  <b>Questions 23-25</b>
 ask about your bank's expectations for the behavior of these measures of loan quality in 2011. Question 23 asks about C&amp;I loans to large and middle-market firms and to small firms. Question 24 asks about CRE loans, and question 25 asks about loans to households.     </i>
<text><p><p>23. 
	    
Assuming that economic activity progresses in line with consensus forecasts, what is your outlook for delinquencies and chargeoffs on your bank's <b>C&amp;I loans</b>
 to large and middle-market firms and to small firms in 2011?
